s! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skills such as anchor turns and explosive cannonballs to aid you in combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken your enemies and board them for extra rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manoeuvre your ships with the wind and devastate your enemies with raking shots.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a fleet of up to seven ships to aid you in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320880/extras/acf74ced76fdc6505191ae9821dd53f6.poster.avif?t=1782455438\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320880/extras/acf74ced76fdc6505191ae9821dd53f6.webm?t=1782455438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320880/extras/acf74ced76fdc6505191ae9821dd53f6.mp4?t=1782455438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Over 30 detailed period correct ships, all the way from 6 gun sloops to massive 160 gun Man'O'Wars!<br>Recruit up to 6 other captains to your fleet!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LIVING BREATHING WORLD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade galleons carry vast wealth across the seas while pirates hunt them in search of gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce pirate hunters await their chance at vengeance and justice. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navies dynamically war on the shores and open seas for control of territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sea monsters lurk below the surface, eagerly awaiting the next unsuspecting ship to become their prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nations create alliances and start wars in their quest for dominance over land and sea.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_u