ag\" >ROARING SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and time of day offer an ever changing environment. From calm, clear sunrises to fierce ship sized waves, howling winds, and pouring rains. Witness mighty thunder storms and battle fierce tornadoes! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOU ALLIANCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 14 different factions to enlist with, from all over the world! Affect their destinies and rewrite their history to your liking. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR SHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather upgrades from enemies, find them from hidden treasure, or plunder them from merchants. Use them to enhance your ship and crew in a variety of ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use copper plated hulls to improve your ship's speed </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip bronze cannons to increase accuracy and damage of your cannonballs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize sails that will forever symbolize the might of your fleet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dozens of more ways to turn your ship into one that you have always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So what are you waiting for? Buy now and set sail in the Seven Seas! </strong></p>", "short_description": "Become a Mighty Captain in a Age of sail naval combat game, set in all of the Seven Seas! Sail the entire world: conquering, boarding, plundering, exploring and trading along the way! Gather your crew, ready your ship, hoist your sails and enter a world of swashbuckling and piracy!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320880/d3a5ae04c2f6ce5e17b16ac6f1899949a7a75a11/header.jpg?t=1782455438", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320880/cc63e5b983